<% @title = "Welcome to HappenHub!" %>

<h2>Hello, <%= @username %>! 🎉</h2>
<p>We’re thrilled to have you join HappenHub! Get ready to organize, plan, and enjoy events with your friends.</p>

<p>Your profile tag is <strong><%= @user_tag %></strong>. Share it so friends can find you fast.</p>

<p>
  <a href="<%= @account_url %>" class="button">Finish setting up your profile</a>
</p>

<p>Need help? Feel free to reach out anytime.</p>
